<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Harleysville EPS cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Harleysville EPS cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Tuesday it reduced its earnings estimates on Harleysville Group Inc to reflect hurricane losses incurred during the third quarter.</p>
<p>--Its new Q3 estimate for the insurance holding company is earnings of $0.24 a share, down from $0.70. Its 1996 estimate now is $1.93, down from $2.39.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk, 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
